# Builder's hut (the Constructor): it invests the stone in its stock into the nearest own-team blueprint or damaged
# structure within "Constructor range". A 2x2x2 m box (1x1 cell). Spawned origin 1.0 above the ground.
# SHAPE (a placeholder; uniform scales of the baseshapes variants): a small WORKSHOP - a stone base (the root), a
# timber upper part, an orange roof (its old colour, so it still reads as "the orange one"), a pole on the roof with
# an orange sign plate, and a crate at a corner. The child pieces are render-only.
